    /* Sprocket-hole rails. The strip is solid celluloid colour; a mask
       punches rectangular holes through it so the page background (or
       Brick-Grid canvas, where visible) shows. Holes are sized to match
       a real 35mm Bell & Howell perforation pitch in feel: tight pattern
       with ~10 holes per frame width. Each rail has TWO rows of holes —
       one larger row near the gate and a thin highlight strip outside
